# Rebuild generated output inside the image.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/dist/
**/node_modules/
**/.vite/
**/*.Api/wwwroot/
**/coverage/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Local state and credentials are not image inputs.
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/appsettings.Target.json
**/appsettings.Machine.json
**/.local/
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12
**/*.key

# Editor, operating-system, and repository metadata.
**/.git/
**/.idea/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/*.user
**/.DS_Store

# Adopted pilot data must never become a container build input.
**/App_Data/
